usage: restore.py [-h] --package PACKAGE --manifest-sha256 MANIFEST_SHA256
                  --output OUTPUT

Restore an actual sealed formal-pair publication into one fresh workspace.
Source-only preparation: this file has only been AST parsed, never imported or
invoked. No actual package currently exists. The future CLI verifies the
entire package before creating output; it restores bytes and file modes, never
uid/gid, containers, training, simulation or model quality. It does not
overwrite/retry.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --package PACKAGE
  --manifest-sha256 MANIFEST_SHA256
  --output OUTPUT
